e profit capture \u2014 no moat to protect margins","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Trading near 52-week highs \u2014 the market has already recognised the story","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.5644891122278068},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Piotroski score 4/9 \u2014 below the median for a healthy business","sev":"amber","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Value-trap profile (score 52/100): leveraged balance sheet under pressure; roic below cost of capital \u2014 cheapness may reflect deterioration, not mispricing","sev":"amber","cat":"value_trap"},{"text":"Climate and insurance cost escalation \u2014 rising premiums and coverage withdrawals in flood/fire zones are repricing assets that the market once treated as perpetuities.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 58% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","Large open-market insider purchases (net $0.5M) \u2014 management putting its own capital behind the business"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"PEB or OHI: Which Is the Better Value Stock Right Now?","source":"finance.yahoo.com","link":"https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/peb-ohi-better-value-stock-154003471.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794584403.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.874,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"Avoiding Lag: Real-Time Signals in (PEB) Movement","source":"news.stocktradersdaily.com","link":"https://news.stocktradersdaily.com/news_release/98/Avoiding_Lag:_Real-Time_Signals_in_PEB_Movement_111226115201_1794545521.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794545521.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.153,"tier":0,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"What Does Final Medicare Cover Mean for Pacific Edge (ASX:PEB)?","source":"kalkinemedia.